  "design": {
    "identity": "Beehive shaman with smoky violet chitin head, amber compound eyes, burgundy hood-like thorax, black-green robe wings, hexagonal wax hive on back, two main arms holding ivory wax sigil and simple spear, two braced insect feet; six small amber bees orbit separately.",
    "attack": "Draw spear far behind shoulder, crouch, full-body LEFT spear thrust, antennae and hive follow through; withdraw spear.",
    "cast": "Bend antennae forward, raise wax sigil over head, open both robe wings very wide, arch abdomen and direct a large spiralling bee swarm toward LEFT; close wings and recover.",
    "death": "Swarm disperses, hive tilts, knees fold and shaman collapses on its side; spear and wax sigil remain beside body."
